			<item>
				<title>What Should Sit on the Credenza: Clock, or Hourglass?</title>
				<link>https://www.CSuitNecessities.com/compare/measuring-executive-time/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://www.CSuitNecessities.com/compare/measuring-executive-time/</guid>
				<description>&lt;aside class=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;takeaways-h&#34;&gt;The 30-second verdict&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Traditional gravitas on a credenza → Howard Miller Burton.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Small, modern, restrained → Dalvey Grand Sedan.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Kinetic conversation piece → glass mechanical mantel clock.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Actually manage focus blocks → brass sand timer.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Howard&amp;#43;Miller&amp;#43;Burton&amp;#43;Mantel&amp;#43;Clock&amp;amp;tag=loganbesecker-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Howard Miller Burton Mantel Clock&#34; data-cta=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;Check Price on Amazon&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;takeaways-jump&#34; href=&#34;#full-review&#34;&gt;Or read the full breakdown ↓&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/aside&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Two of these are decor — they signal permanence and taste. One is a working tool that defends an hour of deep work. Decide which job you&amp;rsquo;re hiring for before you spend.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Gravitas on the Credenza: Howard Miller Burton Clock</title>
				<link>https://www.CSuitNecessities.com/reviews/howard-miller-burton/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 18 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://www.CSuitNecessities.com/reviews/howard-miller-burton/</guid>
				<description>&lt;aside class=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;takeaways-h&#34;&gt;The 30-second verdict&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;High-gloss hardwood case with brass detailing — reads as permanence.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Dual chime (Westminster / Ave Maria) with an automatic overnight silence.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Quartz movement, so it keeps time without daily winding.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Sized for a credenza or a broad desk, not a shelf.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Howard&amp;#43;Miller&amp;#43;Burton&amp;#43;Mantel&amp;#43;Clock&amp;amp;tag=loganbesecker-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Howard Miller Burton Mantel Clock&#34; data-cta=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;Check Price on Amazon&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;takeaways-jump&#34; href=&#34;#full-review&#34;&gt;Or read the full breakdown ↓&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/aside&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-a-real-clock-signals&#34;&gt;What a real clock signals&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A phone tells the time. A substantial clock on the credenza tells a visitor that this office is established and unhurried. The Burton&amp;rsquo;s finish and proportions do that job. If you&amp;rsquo;re furnishing an office you want to feel weighty, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Howard&amp;#43;Miller&amp;#43;Burton&amp;#43;Mantel&amp;#43;Clock&amp;amp;tag=loganbesecker-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; class=&#34;out aff&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Howard Miller Burton Mantel Clock&#34; data-cta=&#34;in-content&#34;&gt;check the Amazon price&lt;svg class=&#34;out-ico&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;12&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2.5&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
